From de979517ff6a93d841fa01c1c059946facbd9451 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:57:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] style: format the repository with ruff format

73 Python files were not formatted the way ruff format formats them;
contributors have kept their own changes formatted, but the older files
never were. Run ruff format 0.17 over the repository once, so that a
format check can be enforced and future diffs stay free of formatting
noise. Only formatting changes: the commit is reproduced by running
make fmt (ruff check --fix finds nothing) on its parent.
